{title: Steadfast Love and Faithfulness Have Met}
{subtitle: Psalms 85:11–13}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Bb] | [Dm] |
| [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]Show us your [C6]steadfast love, [Bb]O Lord
[Dm]Grant us your [C6]salvation [Bb]now
[Gm]I will [C]hear what God the [F]Lord [C/E]will [Dm]speak
[Gm]Peace to his people, his [Asus4]faithful [A]ones
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Bb]Let them not [C]turn back to [Dm]folly
His [Bb]salvation is [C]near to those who [Dm]fear him
That [Bb]glory may dwell in our [Asus4][A]land
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Steadfast love and faith[C]fulness have [Bb]met
Righteousness [C]and peace have [Dm]kissed
Faithfulness [C]springs up from the [Bb]earth
Righteousness [C]looks down from [Dm]heaven [Bb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]The Lord himself [C]will give what is [Bb]good
[Dm]Our land will [C]yield its in[Bb]crease
[Gm]Righteous[C]ness goes before [F][Dm]him
[Gm]Makes a path for his [A]steps
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Steadfast love and faith[C]fulness have [Bb]met
Righteousness [C]and peace have [Dm]kissed
Faithful[C]ness springs up from [Bb]the earth
Righteous[C]ness looks down [Dm]from heaven
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]Glory [C]dwells in the [Dm]land
[Bb]Peace [C]speaks to the faith[Dm]ful
Sal[Gm]vation is [A]near
[Dm]Steadfast [C]love a[Bb]bides [C]
{end_of_bridge}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Gm7]Righteous[C]ness goes before [Fmaj7][Dm]him
[Gm]And makes [C]a path for his [Dm]steps [Bb][Dm]
{end_of_verse}
